            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "apa11",
            "text": "A PaymentIntent tracks the lifecycle of one payment from creation to completion, including authentication steps and retries. Create it on your server, confirm it on the client, and read its status from webhooks."
          },
          {
            "kind": "heading",
            "id": "apa12",
            "text": "Endpoints",
            "level": 3
